2 CONC g8, 2001, Internet. Asgaine Mor Alternate name forms: Ugaine More(Hugon
2 CONC y the Great), Ugaine Ma, Ughaine Mor Son of Eochaidh Buadhach[Asgaine M
2 CONC A3r m. Echach Buadaig 652], son of Duach Ladhgrach #59.Married to Ceasi
2 CONC r Chruthach, daughter of the king of the French,according to the Book o
2 CONC f Invasions. Went to conquer France. He held swayover the islands of we
2 CONC stern Europe. He divided Ireland among 22 sons and3 daughters. Slain by B
2 CONC adhbhchadh, also a son of of Eochaidh Buadhach,and the brother of Ugain
2 CONC e More.
