2 NOTE In 1892, William and his brother Sam were on their way to the golfields
3 CONC but heard such horrible tales that they stopped in Strathcona (south of
3 CONC Edmonton) Alberta. They homesteaded in Chipman. At one of the socialgat
3 CONC herings, he bought the supper hamper produced by Christina Boss. Inappr
3 CONC ox. 1900, William bought a 1/4 section in Partidge Hill District, 2mile
3 CONC s from the Boss farm. In about 1915, he bought another 1/4 sectionfrom t
3 CONC he CPR.
