2 CONC and, after being decimated and robbed, that its general, DukeGodfrey of L
2 CONC orraine, was imprisoned and only released after he swore hewould not re
2 CONC turn to avenge his defeat. These 'Friesians' didn't liketheir counts bu
2 CONC t outside interference was even more resented.
