2 CONC isdomain. This was formally acknowledged by Emperor Otto III as a rewar
2 CONC dfor his support. At about 940, Dirk II extended his influence southwar
2 CONC dsby marrying Hildegard, daughter of the Count of Flanders, a descendan
2 CONC tof Charlemagne and a great-granddaughter of Alfred the Great, king ofE
2 CONC ngland. Dirk II and Hildegard replaced the wooden church of Egmond with
2 CONC a stone Abbey church where both of them were buried.
