2 NOTE "Ross at Arisaig on Monday 15th inst., in the 29th year of age, Margare
3 CONC tMcDougall, beloved wife of John J. Ross leaving a sorrowing husband to
3 CONC mourn the loss of an affectionate partner and 2 young children to facet
3 CONC his cold and bitter world without the guiding hand and tender care of a
3 CONC loving mother. Strenghtened by all the consolations of holy religionund
3 CONC er the eyes and prayers of her spititual father, she calmly breathedher l
3 CONC ife away with the light of hope into life eternal illuminating hercount
3 CONC enance. Hers were the mildness of disposition and kindliness ofmanner."
