4 TEXT "Various sources for this information; Rene Jette, 'DictionnaireGenealo
5 CONC gique des Familles du Quebec', 1983, University of Montreal; 'LesLamber
5 CONC t D'Amerique', conference of 4 October, 1992, speach written byLuc Lamb
5 CONC ert; 'History de la Seigneurie de Lauzon' by Joeph-Edmond Roy,1897, Pag
5 CONC e 255. Vol. 1; 'Dictionnaire bibliographique du Canada', by J.Monet, Vo
5 CONC lume 1, 1966 Published in Quebec; 'Historique de la FermeLambert de St-
5 CONC Nicolas', and excerpt from Terre Illustre, newsletter ofL'Association d
5 CONC es Lambert d'Amerique Inc, October 1992, Volume 1, numero2; Also from a s
5 CONC peech given by Adrien LAmbert, Ex-Deputy of Bellechasse,to the Canadian P
5 CONC arlement at the 350th Anniversary of the arrival of thefirst two Lamber
5 CONC ts to arrive in New France in 1634; and Midland, OntarioChamber of Comm
5 CONC erce, 208 King St., P.O. Box 158, Midland, Ontario,Canada, L4R 4K8.
