1 NOTE Between 916 and 919 she became the second wife of Charles III 'theSimpl
2 CONC e', King of France, who in 922 was imprisoned by Heribert II deVermando
2 CONC is. In 923 she fled to her brother, King Aethelstan, in Englandand, in 9
2 CONC 36, returned to France. From 936 onwards she was in the Abbeyof Notre D
2 CONC ame in Laon until, in 951, she married Heribert de Vermandois,Count of M
2 CONC eaux, son of her first husband's captor. This Heribert, afterher death, b
2 CONC ecame Abbot of St. Medard in Soissons.
2 CONT
2 CONT Naissance : 896 ou plutôt vers 905
