1 NOTE In 840 he became Count of Maasgau and, from 846 till 849, Count ofLomme
2 CONC ngau. He abducted Irmingard, daughter of the Emperor Lothar, andmarried h
2 CONC er in Aquitaine before March 846. It was only after the diet inThionvil
2 CONC le, October 848, that the Emperor made his peace with him. In863 Giselb
2 CONC ert also became Count of Darnau and died after 14 July 877.
