2 TYPE Misc
2 NOTE "Betsy (1823-Mar. 12, 1874,) md. Angus MacDonald, (1814- June 22, 1884,
3 CONC )son of Dougald 'Mohr' MacDonald) on Feb. 22, 1847. They lived atMalign
3 CONC ant Cove. He was appt'd a Justice of the Peace in 1864. They had afamil
3 CONC y of at least eight. One son, Willie, married a niece of FatherRonald M
3 CONC acGillivray. Father Anthony MacDonald of Antigonish Diocease,along with h
3 CONC is brother Rickie and sister Margie, are great-grandchildrenof Angus an
3 CONC d Betsy (Ross) MacDonald, being the children of Dougald, (whomd. Jean M
3 CONC acDonald) son of Willie, son of Angus."
