2 TYPE Misc
2 NOTE He married Catherine MacAdam February 11, 1862 (This marriage date wast
3 CONC aken from the Casket), daughter of Ronald MacAdam. She was born 1840 in
3 CONC Malignant Cove, and died May 26, 1921 in North Grant age 80. Obitutaryf
3 CONC rom the Casket, Antigonish "An old, widely-known and highly-respectedre
3 CONC sident of Malignant Cove, Peter Ross, Esq., departed this life on the8t
3 CONC h inst., at the age of 74, after a painful illness of eight weeks,borne w
3 CONC ith edifying Christian patience. The deceased carried on amerchantile b
3 CONC usiness at that place for many years, and by his industry,integrity and c
3 CONC loss attention to his affairs, acquired a gererouscompetence of this wo
3 CONC rld's good. His customers always found him generousand forbearing, and h
3 CONC is death causes regret whereever he was known.During his illness he fre
3 CONC quently and devotingly received the sacramentsand he yielded his soul t
3 CONC o God in the firm hope of an eternal reward.His funeral was on the 10th i
3 CONC nst. was very largely attended. May he restin peace."
