2 CONC s: 'No one remarried as swiftly as Isabel deVermandois.At most a few da
2 CONC ys after the death of her first husbandRobert deBeaumont, count of Meul
2 CONC an and later earl of Leicester, IsabelwedWilliam II de Warenne, earl of S
2 CONC urrey.  Henry ofHuntingdonsalaciously reports that she ran off with Wil
2 CONC liam while Robertlaydying; it is more likely that William seized the ea
