2 CONC alcolm king of Scots, to Henry I.  Isabel bore William at leastfivechil
2 CONC dren before his death twenty years later.   Between hertwomarriages she w
2 CONC as married over forty-two years, gave birth to atleastthirteen children
2 CONC , and outlived two husbands.' Although Weis givesa death date of Februa
