1 NOTE [Constance.-Walter.le.Blount.ancestors.ged] Robert de Brus married Emma
2 CONC ,daughter of Alan of Brittany. They had two sons. William and Robert.Th
2 CONC is Robertde Brus was the first of the family, a noble Knight ofNormandy
2 CONC , who accompanied Duke William into England, and was rewarded byhim aft
2 CONC er the Battle of Hastings with no less than ninety-four lordshipsin the C
2 CONC ounty of York, of which the Manor of Skelton was the capital ofhis baro
2 CONC ny. He died about the year 1100, according to some, and to otherhistori
2 CONC ans 1094. His successor was his son, Robert.
