1 NOTE [Constance.-Walter.le.Blount.ancestors.ged] Gorm, the Old, so called fr
2 CONC omthelength of his reign. He marrie d the beautiful Thyra Dannebod(Orna
2 CONC ment of Denmark), daughter o f Harold Klak. They had twin sons,Knud and H
2 CONC arold, rivals in gl ory. Knud was the favorite of his father,and had be
2 CONC en absent so metime, and the King fearing his death had vowedto kill th
2 CONC e on e that brought the news of his death. Finally the noticeof hi s de
2 CONC ath was given and the Queen, not risking to tell it to the King, made a
2 CONC ll the courtiers observe an unusual silence at the ta ble andhad the ap
2 CONC artment covered with black. Guessing the reaso n, Gorm criedout: 'Surel
2 CONC y Knud, my dear son, is dead as all Den mark is mourning.''Thou sayest s
2 CONC o, not I.' answered the Queen ; upon which the Kingsickened with grief a
2 CONC nd died in a good ol d age, in 941.
