4 CONC uglas Subject: Baby News Dear Family,I missed my firstscheduled game of g
4 CONC olf because of Alexis!  She delivered a healthy andbeautiful daughter, 7 l
4 CONC bs 13 oz, on Friday night.  Her name is Maya(Greek for beautiful one), M
4 CONC ichelle, Lida.  Michelle is Dino's deceasedmother's name ( she died whe
4 CONC n he was 14).  We are very proud and pleasedfor them.  We had gone over T
4 CONC hursday night because of a false alarm tolook after Grant and when she w
4 CONC ent in on Friday, we took Grant home withus.  We looked after him until S
4 CONC unday then slept in 'til 8:30 thismorning!!! ( Monday).  It does take t
4 CONC wo of us to look after him but heis nevertheless such a delight that we d
4 CONC on't pass up anyopportunity.This is just a short bulletin. Pictures etc t
4 CONC o follow.Lovebruce & lida
