2 CONC for the Magna Charta, died Dec. 30, 1218; married Amicia, 2nddaughter o
2 CONC fWilliam Count of Meullent by Mabel de Bellomont (of RoyalDescent), son
2 CONC of Robert the Consul, created in 1109 Earl ofGloucester, natural son of
2 CONC Henry I by Elizabeth de Bellomont, greatgranddaughter of Henry I, Kingo
2 CONC f France. Source:  Browning's Magna Charta Barons and TheirDescendants, p
2 CONC p.94-96, 122-3, 305.He was the sixth Earl of Clare,Hertford andGloucest
2 CONC er (1173-1217); Magna Carta Surety, 1215.  Presentat thecoronation of K
2 CONC ing Richard on September 3, 1189, and of King JohnonMay 27, 1199.  He s
2 CONC ided with the Barons against King John and asaresult his castle of Tonb
2 CONC ridge was taken. On November 9, 1215 he wasoneof the commissioners on t
2 CONC he part of the Barons to develop peacewith theKing.  On March 4, 1216 h
2 CONC is lands were granted to Robert deBetun, and heand his son were among t
2 CONC he Barons excmmunicated by PopeInnocent III in1215 (From Magna Carts, p
2 CONC . 58, 59).
