1 NOTE BIOGRAPHY
2 CONT  Hugo de Calvacamp was born probably about 880, the son or grandson ofM
2 CONC alahulcius, who came to Normandy from Norway on a Viking ship. The name
2 CONC of his wife is unknown but they are recorded as the parents of threechi
2 CONC ldren. His eldest son Hugo, also called Wigo, was born about 912. In942 h
2 CONC e was made archbishop of Rouen by the duke of Normandy. An unnameddaugh
2 CONC ter was endowed with Douvrend and married first Odo (Eudes), miles,and a
2 CONC fter his death she married Henri, a relative of Gautier II leBlanc, cou
2 CONC nt of Valois and Mantes. His second son, Radulf I, becameseigneur of To
2 CONC sny.
