2 CONC ndNH, at the turn of the century in search of work in the local papermi
2 CONC lls. Although, my father spoke French as a child, his generation wasthe f
2 CONC irst to adopt, English as it's primary language. There are about3500 pe
2 CONC ople in this file, and, most everything is sourced and identifiedin the N
2 CONC OTES files. Enjoy. imported on 19/04/1997 at 12:57:47.
