1 NOTE From: Corbett [bruce.lida.corbett@sympatico.ca]Sent: April 26, 2004 19:
2 CONC 25To: Miousse, Andree; Kristann; Joyce Boudreau; Joel Morin;joanne.boud
2 CONC reau@scotiabank.com; Jennifer A. Leduc; Cathy & Ray Boudreau>; Carol Do
2 CONC uglas Subject: Baby News Dear Family,I missed my firstscheduled game of g
2 CONC olf because of Alexis!  She delivered a healthy andbeautiful daughter, 7 l
2 CONC bs 13 oz, on Friday night.  Her name is Maya(Greek for beautiful one), M
2 CONC ichelle, Lida.  Michelle is Dino's deceasedmother's name ( she died whe
2 CONC n he was 14).  We are very proud and pleasedfor them.  We had gone over T
2 CONC hursday night because of a false alarm tolook after Grant and when she w
2 CONC ent in on Friday, we took Grant home withus.  We looked after him until S
2 CONC unday then slept in 'til 8:30 thismorning!!! ( Monday).  It does take t
2 CONC wo of us to look after him but heis nevertheless such a delight that we d
2 CONC on't pass up anyopportunity.This is just a short bulletin. Pictures etc t
2 CONC o follow.Lovebruce & lida
